HOW TO RUN - AI-Based System Performance Analyzer

1) Open PowerShell and go to the project folder:

   Set-Location "C:\Users\HP USER\Desktop\AI Based System Performance Analyzer"

2) (First time only) Install all required Python packages:

   python -m pip install -r "requirements.txt"

3) Start the real-time analyzer:

   python main.py

4) Open your browser and go to:

   http://127.0.0.1:5000

You will see the real-time dashboard (CPU/RAM/Disk, AI explanation, risk, anomalies, antivirus and suspicious process highlights).